WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.392
Chomp! Chomp! Chomp!

2
00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:17.087
The robot shark shot toward Roxy.

3
00:00:17.088 --> 00:00:19.860
"Whoa!" Roxy darted to the side.

4
00:00:19.861 --> 00:00:23.179
The shark's snapping jaws just missed her.

5
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.403
People on the street below pointed.

6
00:00:25.404 --> 00:00:28.978
"A flying robot shark!" a man cried.

7
00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:31.894
"Run!" a woman shouted.

8
00:00:31.895 --> 00:00:36.682
The shark flew at Roxy again. Its jaws were wide open.

9
00:00:36.683 --> 00:00:40.939
Whoosh! Roxy blew her freeze breath at the shark.

10
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.910
Its jaws froze in place.

11
00:00:43.911 --> 00:00:47.991
Roxy grabbed the shark and swung it toward the ground.

12
00:00:47.992 --> 00:00:50.994
It smashed into a million pieces.

13
00:00:50.995 --> 00:00:54.068
"Now I need to catch Bonnie Bones!"

14
00:00:54.069 --> 00:00:55.616
Zoom!

15
00:00:55.617 --> 00:00:59.551
She spotted the pirate ship flying over Metro City Park.

16
00:00:59.552 --> 00:01:01.941
Roxy landed on the ship's deck.

17
00:01:01.957 --> 00:01:04.246
Bonnie Bones stood at the wheel.

18
00:01:04.247 --> 00:01:06.692
A big cannon sat near her.

19
00:01:06.693 --> 00:01:10.603
"Land this ship right now!" Roxy shouted.

20
00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:13.084
"I'm taking you to jail!"

21
00:01:13.085 --> 00:01:15.269
"Jail!" the parrot sang.

22
00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:21.635
"Arr!" Bonnie Bones pointed the cannon at Roxy and lit the fuse.

23
00:01:21.636 --> 00:01:24.475
Boom! A cannonball shot out.

24
00:01:24.476 --> 00:01:27.241
Roxy leaped forward and caught the cannonball.

25
00:01:27.242 --> 00:01:32.089
Bonnie's eyes went wide. "How did you . . . ?"

26
00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.587
Roxy rolled the cannonball back at Bonnie.

27
00:01:34.588 --> 00:01:37.631
The pirate jumped out of the way.

28
00:01:37.632 --> 00:01:40.075
Then she lit the fuse again.

29
00:01:40.076 --> 00:01:41.724
Roxy stared hard.

30
00:01:41.725 --> 00:01:47.155
Orange beams shot from her eyes and melted the cannon.

31
00:01:47.156 --> 00:01:50.101
"Arr!" Bonnie tried to run away.

32
00:01:50.102 --> 00:01:54.646
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

33
00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.668
Bonnie blocked the laser beams with her hook.

34
00:01:57.669 --> 00:02:07.044
The beams bounced off and hit the ship's wheel. Ka-boom!

35
00:02:07.045 --> 00:02:14.430
"Ahh!" Bonnie held onto a railing as the ship crash-landed in the park.

36
00:02:14.431 --> 00:02:16.582
The ship's hull broke open.

37
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:22.514
Money from the pirates' bank robberies spilled out.

38
00:02:22.515 --> 00:02:25.758
Jack gasped. "Pirate treasure!"

39
00:02:25.759 --> 00:02:32.217
Mara pointed at the ship's deck. "Rocket Girl!"

40
00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.750
Roxy stood in front of Bonnie.

41
00:02:34.751 --> 00:02:37.303
The pirate looked over her shoulder.

42
00:02:37.304 --> 00:02:39.532
She was standing on the ship's plank.

43
00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:41.397
It was a long way down.

44
00:02:41.398 --> 00:02:43.971
Police officers waited below.

45
00:02:43.972 --> 00:02:47.589
"You have two choices," Roxy said.

46
00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:52.846
"Go to jail now—or after you walk the plank!"

47
00:02:52.847 --> 00:02:55.688
"Walk the plank!" the parrot sang.

48
00:02:55.689 --> 00:02:57.688
Bonnie Bones hung her head.

49
00:02:57.689 --> 00:03:03.702
"Arr. I guess we're going to jail."

50
00:03:03.703 --> 00:03:06.882
Later Roxy found her friends in the park.

51
00:03:06.883 --> 00:03:09.600
"Where were you?" Mara asked.

52
00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:12.661
"You missed all the excitement!"

53
00:03:12.662 --> 00:03:17.116
"Really?" Roxy asked. "Did you find the box?"

54
00:03:17.117 --> 00:03:22.019
"We saw something better," Jack said. "Pirate's treasure!"

55
00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.207
Terrell nodded.

56
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:27.933
"Rocket Girl found it. But you probably knew that, right?"

57
00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:32.878
"Huh?" Jack said. "How would Roxy know that?"

58
00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:39.239
Just then Roxy spotted something under a shrub. "The box!"

59
00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.423
They ran over to see what was inside.

60
00:03:42.424 --> 00:03:44.777
"Whew," Roxy thought.

61
00:03:44.778 --> 00:03:48.333
"My secret is still safe."
